{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.950000762939453,"text":"My whole weekend is in this bag. This is the Weekender from Volantra. It's a Birkin-inspired shape, scaled up to a travel bag, leather and canvas, gold hardware, no logo anywhere. Jacket's Veronica Beard, trousers are Frame, the hat has no brand, David Uriman cuff, and the watch is Rolex. Holds three days, slides in the overhead bend, four colors, and it's $50 off right now. Links below.","words":[{"word":"My","start":0.5799999833106995,"end":1.1399999856948853},{"word":"whole","start":1.1399999856948853,"end":1.440000057220459},{"word":"weekend","start":1.440000057220459,"end":1.7999999523162842},{"word":"is","start":1.7999999523162842,"end":2.259999990463257},{"word":"in","start":2.259999990463257,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"this","start":2.4200000762939453,"end":2.680000066757202},{"word":"bag","start":2.680000066757202,"end":2.940000057220459},{"word":"This","start":3.319999933242798,"end":3.4000000953674316},{"word":"is","start":3.4000000953674316,"end":3.5399999618530273},{"word":"the","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":3.759999990463257},{"word":"Weekender","start":3.759999990463257,"end":4.139999866485596},{"word":"from","start":4.139999866485596,"end":4.559999942779541},{"word":"Volantra","start":4.559999942779541,"end":5.059999942779541},{"word":"It's","start":5.380000114440918,"end":5.440000057220459},{"word":"a","start":5.440000057220459,"end":5.739999771118164},{"word":"Birkin","start":5.739999771118164,"end":5.840000152587891},{"word":"inspired","start":5.840000152587891,"end":6.300000190734863},{"word":"shape","start":6.300000190734863,"end":6.760000228881836},{"word":"scaled","start":7.119999885559082,"end":7.199999809265137},{"word":"up","start":7.199999809265137,"end":7.460000038146973},{"word":"to","start":7.460000038146973,"end":7.579999923706055},{"word":"a","start":7.579999923706055,"end":7.840000152587891},{"word":"travel","start":7.840000152587891,"end":8.020